ob filename text source be input ya

ob filename of ob of source to name filename source filename be filename do
ob text of ob of source filename to name text source path be text do

ob text "dirname \"" to name text dir cmd be text do
ob name source path to name dir cmd be plus do
ob text "\" | tr -d '\\n'" to name dir cmd be plus do
su name dir stage ob name text dir cmd be command do

ob text "basename \"" to name text stem cmd be text do
ob name source path to name stem cmd be plus do
ob text "\" | sed 's/\\.[^.]*$//' | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
su name stem stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

ob name dir stage to name text wise path be plus do
ob text "/" to name wise path be plus do
ob name stem stage to name wise path be plus do
ob text "_wise_chips.series.pya" to name wise path be plus do

ob text "node command/srt_to_wise_chip_series.mjs \"" to name text wise cmd be text do
ob name source path to name wise cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name wise cmd be plus do
ob name wise path to name wise cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name wise cmd be plus do

su name wise stage ob name text wise cmd be command do
su name output stage ob name wise path be write do
